combinationItems.description:
The combination items (component case + multiplying factor rows) that make up this case.
Populated only when `?expand=all` is passed AND `hasCombinationItems` is true;
omitted from the wire otherwise.

restraintCode.description:
6-character restraint code for TX,TY,TZ,RX,RY,RZ. Each character is one of:
F = Fixed (prevents movement);
R = Released (allows movement);
S = Spring (movement governed by a spring stiffness);
V = Variable spring (multiple stiffnesses via a stiffness-vs-deflection table);
P = Plastic (upper force/moment limit on the reaction);
N = Friction (upper limit proportional to the normal-axis reaction).
